<body>
    <h1>Domain Configuration for Active Directory/Kerberos in IGEL OS 12</h=
1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>This article shows how to configure domains for the Active Direc=
tory/Kerberos configuration in IGEL OS. Up to four domains can be configure=
d.</p>
<hr>
<p>Menu path: <strong>Security &gt; Active Directory/Kerberos &gt; Domain [=
1-4]</strong></p>
<p></p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper c=
onfluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image con=
fluence-content-image-border image-left" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=
=3D"bdf0f333c99fca4a2ba95cba171cabc13f60baf294da524ae9fcf667cb01ae36" data-=
image-src=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/7330=
2313/OS12_Actived%20Kerberos_Domain.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D=
1716364680920&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"953" data-w=
idth=3D"1126" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=
=3D"73308798" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=
=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"OS12_Actived Kerberos=
_Domain.png" data-base-url=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki" data-li=
nked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=
=3D"73302313" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"5" data-media-id=3D=
"d1d924ea-a3da-4049-a7c3-4fe0a6a9d506" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"3=
96"></span>
<p></p>
<p><strong>Fully qualified domain name</strong></p>
<p>Name of the domain</p>
<p></p>
<p><strong>Domain Controller List</strong></p>
<p>To manage the list of domain controllers:</p>
<div class=3D"error">
<span class=3D"error">Unable to render {include}</span> The included page c=
ould not be found.
</div>
<p></p>
<p><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">To configure a domain, proceed a=
s follows:</span></p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Under <strong>Fully qualified domain name</strong>, give the name of the=
 domain (Kerberos realm).<br></p></li>
<li>
<p>Click&nbsp;<span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper"><img class=
=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-inline" alt=3D"image=
-20240716-135702.png" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"87a0cc455a4ba3e2b862224055f80=
07f8d77b07083b697db802b89315ad6a5a9" data-image-src=3D"https://igel-jira.at=
lassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/73302313/image-20240716-135702.png?ve=
rsion=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1721138224635&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=
=3Dv2" data-height=3D"25" data-width=3D"27" data-unresolved-comment-count=
=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"121831594" data-linked-resource-version=
=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-defaul=
t-alias=3D"image-20240716-135702.png" data-base-url=3D"https://igel-jira.at=
lassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-link=
ed-resource-container-id=3D"73302313" data-linked-resource-container-versio=
n=3D"5" data-media-id=3D"58757e11-e184-4b89-8e38-cd3afa0457b6" data-media-t=
ype=3D"file" width=3D"27" height=3D"25"></span> to create a new entry.<br><=
/p></li>
<li>
<p>Under&nbsp;<strong>Domain Controller</strong>, give the name or IP addre=
ss of the domain controller (Kerberos Key Distribution Center). A port numb=
er can be added to the host name; the port name must be preceded by a colon=
.<br></p></li>
<li>
<p>Click&nbsp;<strong>Confirm</strong>.<br>
The domain controller will be added to the&nbsp;<strong>Domain Controller L=
ist</strong>.</p></li>
</ol>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
